    <innerclass refid="class_pane_component" prot="public">PaneComponent</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Pure virtual base for pane-hosted components (Terminal, Whelmed). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_pane_component" kindref="compound">PaneComponent</ref> provides the shared interface that Panes uses to manage heterogeneous pane types without type inspection. Both <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_display" kindref="compound">terminal::Display</ref> and <ref refid="classwhelmed_1_1_component" kindref="compound">whelmed::Component</ref> inherit from this.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_display" kindref="compound">terminal::Display</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
